        "original_id": "c814175c-5dd4-5595-a48e-3fb8fb47809c",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Places: Dubai Textile Souk, Dubai Gold Souk, Dubai Spice Souk, Dubai Creek, Bur Dubai, Deira\n- Topics: textile markets, gold markets, abra transport\n\nFacts:\n- Dubai Textile Souk is a traditional textile market in the historic Bur Dubai neighbourhood of Dubai.\n- Dubai Textile Souk is also known as the Old Textile Souk.\n- Dubai Spice Souk and Dubai Gold Souk are located in Deira on the opposite side of Dubai Creek from Dubai Textile Souk.\n- Special abra boats provide access across Dubai Creek between Dubai Textile Souk and the souks in Deira.\n- Dubai Gold Souk consists of over 300 retailers, most of whom are jewellery traders.",
